      "created_at": "2018-03-27T17:23:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello all!</p><p>Apparently I'm like about 7 years late in discovering the Sentinels multiverse.</p><p>Spotted it recently via Ads and articles in the GTM trade magazine and promptly</p><p>picked up the Sentinels Comics RPG starter kit as I intend to run the full game when it</p><p>comes out. (yeah, via kickstarter I read that part.&nbsp; :-))</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I want to brush up on the multiverse lore and all the Heroes and Villains past history.</p><p>To that note, I also just bought the:</p><p>Sentinels of the Multiverse cardgame</p><p>Rook City &amp; Infernal Relics expanson</p><p>Shattered Timelines &amp; Wrath of the Cosmos expansion</p><p>and the single \"Unity\" and \"Miss Information\" packs.</p><p>I'm hoping they will help fill me in on the various characters and some of their</p><p>past history before i start running the RPG.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Any other good sources of lore for me to use in prepping for running the RPG?</p><p>Thanks, in advance, for your replies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
