      "created_at": "2018-03-27T18:02:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not above self-plugging:&nbsp;</p><p>If you're looking for items to prep for upcoming RPG sessions, I have a \"Villain of the Day\" program ongoing a thread in this very sub-forum.&nbsp; Check out \"The Big Villains\" thread for a new villain every day, usually around noon.</p><p>Keep in mind; none of those are canon.&nbsp; While many of them have references and background elements that fit them within the greater multiverse at large, they're my own creations, not those of Christopher, Adam, or anyone else at Greater Than Games.</p>",
